      "message": "`BigDecimal` now compares and hashes by numeric value instead of by spelling. `\"1e2\"` equals `\"100\"`, `\"1.0\"` equals `\"1.00\"`, `\"+5\"` equals `\"5\"`, and every spelling of zero, such as `\"-0.0\"` and `\"0\"`, is equal. `AsRef<str>` still returns the original string, so serialization doesn't change.\n",
